# Generated by `node generate-backgrounds.mjs`, byte-identically, in a second. Committing
# 12MB of gradients that a script rebuilds on demand is a worse trade than regenerating.
aso/backgrounds/*.png

# The per-slide background is a renamed copy of one of the above — same reasoning.
aso/backgrounds/aso/*.png

# The device captures are NOT regenerable: each needs a simulator, the seeded screenshot
# data, and the right screen state. Slides 1-8 lost theirs and can no longer be recomposed —
# only their finished PNGs survive. Don't let that happen twice.
!aso/backgrounds/aso/*-device.png
